## 🚀 Installation (Step-by-Step)

```bash
git clone https://github.com/shansree-z/Orbit_V4.git
cd Orbit_V4
python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate      # Windows
source venv/bin/activate   # Mac/Linux
pip install -r requirements.txt
python init_db.py
uvicorn main:app --reload --port 8000
Docker alternative:

bash
docker build -t orbit-v4 .
docker run -p 8000:8000 orbit-v4
📖 Usage
Access URLs

HR Dashboard → http://localhost:8000

Manager Dashboard → http://localhost:8000/manager

API Docs → http://localhost:8000/docs

Default Logins

Role	Username	Password
HR	hr@orbit.com	hr123
Manager	manager@orbit.com	mgr123
Quick Start Steps

Login with credentials

HR creates new employee

Orchestrator runs 8 tasks automatically

Monitor real-time progress

Manager retries failed tasks if needed

Onboarding completes ✅

