🔐 API Endpoints
Method	Endpoint	Auth	Role
POST	/api/login	None	Anyone
POST	/api/employees	JWT	HR only
GET	/api/employees	JWT	HR/Manager
GET	/api/employees/{id}/tasks	JWT	HR/Manager
POST	/api/tasks/{id}/retry	JWT	Manager only
GET	/api/logs	JWT	HR only
